Vendored Boost header subset.

Boost Software License 1.0 (see LICENSE_1_0.txt copied from upstream).
Source: Boost 1.90.0, trimmed to the header-only dependency set used by
Dynarmic 6.7.0.

Only the headers are needed (Dynarmic links Boost::boost, the header-only
target). To refresh, copy the required headers from the matching Boost source
tree and verify clean host and Android builds.
